{
  "title": "Hearty Australian Lamb Stew",
  "description": "A rich and flavorful one-pot dish featuring lamb, chives, and tempering chocolate, served in a lacquerware bowl. This halal-friendly stew is perfect for a cold winter's night.",
  "cuisine": "Australian",
  "diet": [
    "halal"
